---
// BlogCTA.astro - Premium CTA for Blog Pages
---

<section class="blog-cta-section" id="blog-cta">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="cta-card">
      <div class="cta-header">
        <span class="cta-badge">＼ 24時間受付中・完全無料見積もり ／</span>
        <h2 class="cta-title">愛車のデッドニング・スピーカー取付<br><span class="text-gold">プロに相談してみませんか？</span></h2>
        <p class="cta-lead">「自分の車だと工賃はいくら？」「このスピーカーは取り付け可能？」など、疑問や不安を何でもお気軽にご相談ください！</p>
      </div>

      <div class="cta-actions">
        <a href="https://lin.ee/g4NPYZ3" target="_blank" class="btn-cta-line pulse" id="blog-cta-line-btn">
          <span class="btn-icon"><i class="fab fa-line"></i></span>
          <span class="btn-text-wrapper">
            <span class="btn-sub">まずは写真とカンタン質問から！</span>
            <span class="btn-main">LINEで無料相談・見積もり</span>
          </span>
        </a>

        <a href="tel:070-8428-0866" class="btn-cta-tel" id="blog-cta-tel-btn">
          <span class="btn-icon"><i class="fas fa-phone-alt"></i></span>
          <span class="btn-text-wrapper">
            <span class="btn-sub">お急ぎの方はこちら（営業時間：9:00〜20:00）</span>
            <span class="btn-main">070-8428-0866</span>
          </span>
        </a>
      </div>

      <div class="cta-footer">
        <p class="cta-note"><i class="fas fa-check-circle"></i> しつこい営業電話や売り込みは一切ありません。ご安心ください。</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .blog-cta-section {
    padding: 60px 0;
    background-color: #f8f9fb;
  }
  .container {
    max-width: 900px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 0 20px;
  }
  .cta-card {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #101524 0%, #1a2238 100%);
    border-radius: 20px;
    padding: 45px 30px;
    box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.15);
    border: 1px solid rgba(212, 175, 55, 0.2);
    text-align: center;
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  .cta-card::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    top: 0;
    left: 0;
    width: 100%;
    height: 4px;
    background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--color-gold, #d4af37) 0%, #fff099 50%, var(--color-gold, #d4af37) 100%);
  }
  .cta-badge {
    display: inline-block;
    color: var(--color-gold, #d4af37);
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    background: rgba(212, 175, 55, 0.1);
    padding: 6px 16px;
    border-radius: 50px;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
    border: 1px solid rgba(212, 175, 55, 0.2);
  }
  .cta-title {
    color: #ffffff;
    font-size: clamp(20px, 4vw, 30px);
    font-weight: 900;
    line-height: 1.4;
    margin-bottom: 15px;
  }
  .text-gold {
    color: var(--color-gold, #d4af37);
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #fff099 0%, var(--color-gold, #d4af37) 100%);
    -webkit-background-clip: text;
    -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
  }
  .cta-lead {
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8);
    font-size: 15px;
    line-height: 1.6;
    max-width: 650px;
    margin: 0 auto 35px;
  }
  .cta-actions {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr));
    gap: 20px;
    max-width: 750px;
    margin: 0 auto 30px;
  }
  
  /* Buttons Common */
  .btn-cta-line, .btn-cta-tel {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    padding: 16px 20px;
    border-radius: 12px;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: all 0.3s ease;
    text-align: left;
    box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2);
  }
  
  .btn-icon {
    font-size: 28px;
    margin-right: 15px;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }
  .btn-text-wrapper {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
  }
  .btn-sub {
    font-size: 11px;
    opacity: 0.85;
    margin-bottom: 2px;
  }
  .btn-main {
    font-size: 17px;
    font-weight: 900;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
  }

  /* LINE Button */
  .btn-cta-line {
    background: #06C755;
    color: #ffffff;
  }
  .btn-cta-line:hover {
    background: #05b04b;
    transform: translateY(-2px);
    box-shadow: 0 6px 20px rgba(6, 199, 85, 0.4);
  }

  /* TEL Button */
  .btn-cta-tel {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #d4af37 0%, #b89224 100%);
    color: #101524;
  }
  .btn-cta-tel:hover {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #e5c14d 0%, #cfa830 100%);
    transform: translateY(-2px);
    box-shadow: 0 6px 20px rgba(212, 175, 55, 0.4);
  }

  /* Pulse Animation */
  .pulse {
    animation: pulse-animation 2s infinite;
  }
  @keyframes pulse-animation {
    0% {
      box-shadow: 0 0 0 0 rgba(6, 199, 85, 0.5);
    }
    70% {
      box-shadow: 0 0 0 12px rgba(6, 199, 85, 0);
    }
    100% {
      box-shadow: 0 0 0 0 rgba(6, 199, 85, 0);
    }
  }

  .cta-note {
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.6);
    font-size: 12px;
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 6px;
    margin: 0;
  }
  .cta-note i {
    color: var(--color-gold, #d4af37);
  }

  @media (max-width: 576px) {
    .cta-card {
      padding: 35px 20px;
    }
    .cta-actions {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
    .btn-main {
      font-size: 16px;
    }
  }
</style>
